# Veyran, Voice of Duality doubles what YOU casting an instant or sorcery triggers (CR 603.2d), even an ability of yours
# that any player's spell triggers - but not when an opponent casts it. Bot1's Ledger Shredder ("Whenever a player casts
# their second spell each turn, this creature connives") is out with Veyran from turn 1. On turn 2 Bot2 casts Mox Ruby, then
# a Lightning Bolt at Bot1, its second spell: the Shredder triggers once (one card drawn and one discarded). On turn 3 Bot1
# casts two Lightning Bolts at Bot2: the second triggers the Shredder twice, and each Bolt triggers Veyran's magecraft
# twice (Veyran 6/6). Every card drawn by conniving is an Island, discarded: no counter.
# Turn 1: Black Lotus (UUU) pays the Shredder's {1}{U} and Veyran's {U}; Mox Ruby its {R} and the Volcanic Island its {1}.
# Turn 3: Mox Ruby and the Volcanic Island pay the Bolts. Bot1's graveyard: the Lotus, three Islands, two Bolts.

